== Project scope ==
Aura Ecosystem is an experimental collection of documentation, web assets, code examples, and research proposals. The repository does not currently establish these components as one integrated production application.

== Repository facts ==
* Repository: https://github.com/auraecosystem/Auraecosystem.github.io
* Website: https://auraecosystem.github.io/
* Default branch: main
* License: not specified
* Release version: not specified

== Implementation caveats ==
* Flutter examples may require additional project configuration.
* SwiftUI code depends on external modules and views not included in the repository.
* MCP artifacts do not constitute a complete LM Studio-to-MCP integration.
* Proposed data formats and research capabilities should not be described as implemented until verified in source.
